n>]，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>回合，若目标处于[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"濒死\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">濒死</font></span></span>]，则无视<font color=\"#ed7950\">80%</font>防御，并施加[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"×不屈\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">×不屈</font></span></span>]。随后在首名被攻击的敌人周围[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">空地</span>]生成1个[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"枪影\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">枪影</font></span></span>]。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 1-5十字 5纵内.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/1/13/f2610ikiuytuoeoa4n5r0gvjrufgp0d.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_1-5%E5%8D%81%E5%AD%97_5%E7%BA%B5%E5%86%85.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/1/13/f2610ikiuytuoeoa4n5r0gvjrufgp0d.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"90\" data-file-height=\"90\" />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E4%BC%A6%E4%BC%BD%E5%8B%92%C2%B7%E4%BC%A0%E6%89%BF%E4%B9%8B%E6%9E%AA\" title=\"角色图鉴库/伦伽勒·传承之枪\"><img alt=\"头像 伦伽勒·传承之枪.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/c/ca/keld4355sxfdrhyfy98uznvf3pyff84.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-heig